  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "On the income schedule line (F-33), after a decide answered 200, the page says the version is approved only when the re-read shows the decided state. While the re-read still serves the review, it shows the neutral \"result not confirmed\" wording F-45 uses, and never \"approved\" or \"verified\". \u2014 verify: component test that fails on the old code.",
    "On the income schedule line, a real two-reviewer sequence through the mock (the task closes, then the second reviewer's decide gets a 409) leaves a lasting stale notice and the unsent note, with no decide buttons. \u2014 verify: test.",
    "On the leadership report line (F-35), the stale notice adds one sentence telling the reviewer what to do next (\"Read the current version above; nothing was recorded for you.\"), and focus moves to the notice when it appears. \u2014 verify: test for the text and `document.activeElement`.",
    "The escalation mock serves W-3602's send-for-review step answer (fixture), so \"Send for review\" completes and the re-read shows the next state. \u2014 verify: mock test plus an e2e or component test.",
    "The response mock answers `POST /api/v1/tasks/T-3401/response` with `team_input` (no 501), so F-37's \"Record team input\" completes with proof on the mock. \u2014 verify: mock test plus a component test of the completed state.",
    "The shared header's History link is at least 44 by 44 px at 390. Desktop is unchanged. \u2014 verify: e2e measuring `getBoundingClientRect` on two lines.",
    "tests/rfp-intake-mock.test.ts no longer fails on ECONNRESET in beforeEach (a retry or `Connection: close`), and the file passes 5 runs in a row. \u2014 verify: the runs.",
    "No other line's behaviour changes. checks.sh passes, and the e2e for income-schedule, leadership-report, escalation, rfp-requirements and one more line passes. \u2014 verify: checks and e2e."
  ],
  "risk": {
    "level": "medium",
    "surfaces": [
      "ui",
